  "body": "Completing Nov 2026! Pre-market release-limited time to secure. Don't wait, call Coco!\r\n\r\nChoosing a brand-new townhouse is choosing a distinct lifestyle-one where the quality of the build far outweighs the underlying land value. The point of difference in the home itself is what determines true value for money and your long-term quality of life. Forget standard off-the-plan developments. Designed with un-compromised attention to detail, these four boutique residences are crafted for buyers seeking luxury, function, and a refined lifestyle. From bespoke built-in storage to high-end interior finishes, every inch of space has been maximised to offer unmatched value.\r\n\r\n|High-End Interior Highlights|\r\n\r\nGourmet Kitchen: Premium Miele appliance package paired with striking natural marble countertops and full-height marble backsplashes.\r\nRefined Flooring: Engineered hardwood flooring flowing seamlessly through the main living area.\r\nClever Storage: Custom-designed smart storage solutions throughout, combining practical living with sleek aesthetics.\r\nTailored Finishes: High-spec fixtures and fittings optimised for true comfort and longevity.\r\n\r\n|The Layouts & Options|\r\n\r\nLots 1, 2 & 3 | Two-Storey Executive Living\r\n3 Bedrooms + Dedicated Study | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Internal Garage\r\nSmart, space-efficient layouts designed for professionals, young families, or downsizers.\r\nLot 1 Bonus: High potential to accommodate up to 2 extra off-street parking spaces.\r\n\r\nLot 4 | The Ultimate Family Sanctuary (Positioned at the Quiet Rear)\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms (Includes 2 Master Suites) | Single Garage + 2 Off-Street Parks\r\nGround Floor Master Suite: Features a full bedroom suite downstairs-ideal for extended family, guests, or direct multi-generational living.\r\nSituated privately at the end of the driveway with exceptional privacy.\r\n\r\n|Unbeatable Location & Convenience|\r\n\r\nSchool Zones: In-zone for premier Auckland schooling, including Rangitoto College.\r\nTransport & Access: Located directly adjacent to Pinehill-just 1 minute from the Greville Road SH1 motorway exchange.\r\nNeighborhood: A flat, wide, and exceptionally quiet street tucked away from main road traffic noise.\r\n\r\n| Proven Reputation & Total Peace of Mind |\r\n\r\nReputable & Experienced Construction Company: Constructed by a highly respected master builder with years of proven expertise in delivering premium-quality homes. This project is backed by a comprehensive 10-Year Master Builder Guarantee, ensuring long-term confidence, durability, and peace of mind for your investment.\r\n\r\n|Early Bird Opportunity|\r\n\r\nSet for completion in November 2026, this project is now open for pre-market securing. Lock in your preferred lot early to secure your dream home and enjoy the opportunity to make non-structural personal customisations to suit your tastes before final handover.\r\n\r\nContact us today to request the architectural plans, specification sheets, or to arrange a private site consultation.",
